Package: faofishingreport
Type: Package
Title: Analyse and Report FAO Global Capture Production Statistics
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Hongyu", "Lin", email = "linbojun99@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Analyses FAO Global Capture Production statistics by fishing area,
    country and species, and exports charts (PNG and editable PowerPoint) and
    tables for reports. Includes breakpoint analysis of catch time series,
    checks for and downloads the latest FAO data release, and draws charts in
    English, Chinese or both, using official FAO Chinese names and a Chinese
    font chosen for the operating system.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/Linbojun99/faofishingreport
BugReports: https://github.com/Linbojun99/faofishingreport/issues
